<Item XName="Constants" UserName="Constants" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>Fsignal = tune(10);&#x0009;% Frequency of the CW signal in GHz&#x000D;&#x000A;Farray  = 10;       % Freq for the absolute spacing of the array elements, GHz&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;NumElements = tune(4);    % number of array elements Num * Num = Num^2&#x000D;&#x000A;SpeedOfLight = 299792458; % meter/sec&#x000D;&#x000A;HalfWavelength = 0.5*SpeedOfLight/(Farray * 1e9);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;BeamTheta = tune(25); %deg&#x000D;&#x000A;BeamPhi = tune(250); %deg&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%freq dependent antenna efficiency, you can optionally set it in the ArrayAnt model&#x000D;&#x000A;AntennaEfficiency = [-10 -1 0 0 -1 -10 -10 -10 -20 -20 -20 -20];&#x000D;&#x000A;AntennaEfficiencyFreqGHz = [1 9 10 11 12 20 21 22 30 31 32 33];</Text>
